			],
			"Message": "fix(Cocoon): Restore missing closing parenthesis in dynamic import\n\nThe prior `)` → `;` bulk refactor stripped the closing parenthesis from the dynamic `import()` expression in the PostHog telemetry bridge, leaving a malformed `import(...;` call.\n\nAdd the missing `)` before `;` to restore valid syntax for the ConditionalImport pattern. This is a pure syntax fix with no behavioral change.",
			"SHA": "bbb622b182c480e02a3dd3371c821a6dbc7253d8"
