			"Message": "docs(Cocoon): Update Test namespace header to reflect fully wired lifecycle\n\nThe module-level JSDoc in `Tests/Namespace.ts` still described the Test API shim as a stub awaiting Mountain/Sky wiring. Update the header block to state that `SendToMountain` + `Output/Source/Service/CEL/Expose/Accessor.ts` now complete the Cocoon → Mountain → Sky lifecycle for `TestRun.*` events and Testing panel rendering.\n\nAlso add a separating blank line before the `Context.SendToMountain(\"tests.run_started\", ...)` call for readability, consistent with the adjacent `SendToMountain` pattern.",
